    "description": "When you damage a target with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack\" title=\"Whirlwind Attack\">Whirlwind Attack</a>, you can choose to move that target 1 square in any direction as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>. You can't move a target that's being <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grabbed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grabbed\">Grabbed</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappled\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappled\">Grappled</a>, and you can't move the opponent into a solid object or another creature's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fighting_Space\" title=\"Fighting Space\">Fighting Space</a>. This forced movement does not provoke <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a>.",
